    "name": "Havenroot Vale",
    "steam_appid": 3152310,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Havenroot Vale is a first person farming and life game that lets you play as a druid with a close connection to nature. Use your bond with the local flora to grow crops, meet unique creatures, and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/a4b06b112d37ae228ef3c097f3b0fdfa.avif?t=1754769055\" data-has-big width=800 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 \u00b7 <span class=\"bb_strike\">--------------------------------------------</span> \u00b7 \ud80c\udefc\ud80c\udf4a \u00b7 <span class=\"bb_strike\">--------------------------------------------</span> \u00b7 \u00b7</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Features</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Restore the Vale</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is sick, but that's why it's called for you! Your bond with the Vale's flora and its nature spirits will guide you to healing what's been lost. Use your magic to heal corrupted groves, awaken slumbering guardians, and figure out how to mend the rift between the Vale and its people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/25a1c8bc1fd239f2e5ffe2398815eaed.poster.avif?t=1754769055\" width=650 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/25a1c8bc1fd239f2e5ffe2398815eaed.webm?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/25a1c8bc1fd239f2e5ffe2398815eaed.mp4?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Druidic Magic to Cultivate Your Farm</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a humble plot of land and nurture it into a thriving farm. Grow everything from everyday vegetables to enchanted herbs. Weave nature\u2019s magic into your crops to help them grow faster, bear special harvests, and more. Build charming structures, tend to woodland companions, and create a farm that feels like home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/fedd1cfc25b12eb66b7ff36c3a71a76a.poster.avif?t=1754769055\" width=650 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/fedd1cfc25b12eb66b7ff36c3a71a76a.webm?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/fedd1cfc25b12eb66b7ff36c3a71a76a.mp4?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend and Care for Unique Wildlife</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sentient mushrooms and tiny frogs to lumbering beasts of the forest, the Vale is filled with creatures to find. Add them to your bestiary and build habitats for them. Larger ones are happy to roam your farm. Care for their needs, and they\u2019ll reward you with materials and companionship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/18a7534b8913866ba2c864ce9db4f6b5.poster.avif?t=1754769055\" width=650 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/18a7534b8913866ba2c864ce9db4f6b5.webm?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/18a7534b8913866ba2c864ce9db4f6b5.mp4?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Own Stall in a Bustling Village Market</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you\u2019re ready to sell, head to town in the morning and set up your own stall at the village market. Choose your stall\u2019s size and style, arrange your displays, and mark your prices. Locals will browse, haggle, and buy if the price is right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/ae56512049e3e1f7720f49391912db36.poster.avif?t=1754769055\" width=650 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/ae56512049e3e1f7720f49391912db36.webm?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/ae56512049e3e1f7720f49391912db36.mp4?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create from What You Grow</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest your crops, gather from the wild, and transform what you collect into something new. Bake bread from your grain, press fruit into juice, smelt ore into ingots, or craft planks into sturdy fences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/f21ea93204e44425a29d1ed6179ce88d.poster.avif?t=1754769055\" width=650 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/f21ea93204e44425a29d1ed6179ce88d.webm?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/f21ea93204e44425a29d1ed6179ce88d.mp4?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 \u00b7 <span class=\"bb_strike\">--------------------------------------------</span> \u00b7 \ud80c\udefc\ud80c\udf4a \u00b7 <span class=\"bb_strike\">--------------------------------------------</span> \u00b7 \u00b7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/68b0be4c45b033d021e19a6fef615841.avif?t=1754769055\" data-has-big width=800 height=218 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Havenroot Vale is a first person farming and life game that lets you play as a druid with a close connection to nature. Use your bond with the local flora to grow crops, meet unique creatures, and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/a4b06b112d37ae228ef3c097f3b0fdfa.avif?t=1754769055\" data-has-big width=800 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 \u00b7 <span class=\"bb_strike\">--------------------------------------------</span> \u00b7 \ud80c\udefc\ud80c\udf4a \u00b7 <span class=\"bb_strike\">--------------------------------------------</span> \u00b7 \u00b7</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Features</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Restore the Vale</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is sick, but that's why it's called for you! Your bond with the Vale's flora and its nature spirits will guide you to healing what's been lost. Use your magic to heal corrupted groves, awaken slumbering guardians, and figure out how to mend the rift between the Vale and its people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/25a1c8bc1fd239f2e5ffe2398815eaed.poster.avif?t=1754769055\" width=650 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/25a1c8bc1fd239f2e5ffe2398815eaed.webm?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/25a1c8bc1fd239f2e5ffe2398815eaed.mp4?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Druidic Magic to Cultivate Your Farm</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a humble plot of land and nurture it into a thriving farm. Grow everything from everyday vegetables to enchanted herbs. Weave nature\u2019s magic into your crops to help them grow faster, bear special harvests, and more. Build charming structures, tend to woodland companions, and create a farm that feels like home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/fedd1cfc25b12eb66b7ff36c3a71a76a.poster.avif?t=1754769055\" width=650 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/fedd1cfc25b12eb66b7ff36c3a71a76a.webm?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/fedd1cfc25b12eb66b7ff36c3a71a76a.mp4?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend and Care for Unique Wildlife</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sentient mushrooms and tiny frogs to lumbering beasts of the forest, the Vale is filled with creatures to find. Add them to your bestiary and build habitats for them. Larger ones are happy to roam your farm. Care for their needs, and they\u2019ll reward you with materials and companionship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/18a7534b8913866ba2c864ce9db4f6b5.poster.avif?t=1754769055\" width=650 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/18a7534b8913866ba2c864ce9db4f6b5.webm?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/18a7534b8913866ba2c864ce9db4f6b5.mp4?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Own Stall in a Bustling Village Market</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you\u2019re ready to sell, head to town in the morning and set up your own stall at the village market. Choose your stall\u2019s size and style, arrange your displays, and mark your prices. Locals will browse, haggle, and buy if the price is right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/ae56512049e3e1f7720f49391912db36.poster.avif?t=1754769055\" width=650 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/ae56512049e3e1f7720f49391912db36.webm?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/ae56512049e3e1f7720f49391912db36.mp4?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create from What You Grow</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest your crops, gather from the wild, and transform what you collect into something new. Bake bread from your grain, press fruit into juice, smelt ore into ingots, or craft planks into sturdy fences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/f21ea93204e44425a29d1ed6179ce88d.poster.avif?t=1754769055\" width=650 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/f21ea93204e44425a29d1ed6179ce88d.webm?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/f21ea93204e44425a29d1ed6179ce88d.mp4?t=1754769055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 \u00b7 <span class=\"bb_strike\">--------------------------------------------</span> \u00b7 \ud80c\udefc\ud80c\udf4a \u00b7 <span class=\"bb_strike\">--------------------------------------------</span> \u00b7 \u00b7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152310/extras/68b0be4c45b033d021e19a6fef615841.avif?t=1754769055\" data-has-big width=800 height=218 /></span></p>",
